# Normalise to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# WHY: docker/initdb/*.sql is bind-mounted into a Linux container and executed
# by the Postgres entrypoint. A CRLF checkout on Windows produces scripts that
# fail in confusing ways inside the container, so line endings are pinned here
# rather than left to each developer's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
